# Phase 8 - Project Summary

## Project Title
Implement Client Script & UI Policy (Incident)

## Platform
ServiceNow

## Table
Incident

## Components Used

- Client Script
- UI Policy
- UI Policy Action
- JavaScript

## Client Script Type

onSubmit

## UI Policy Condition

State is Resolved

## Functionality

When an Incident is moved to Resolved state,
Resolution Notes and Resolution Code are made mandatory.

The Client Script also validates the required values
before submitting the Incident.

## Outcome

The project improves Incident form validation and
ensures that required resolution information is
provided before an Incident is resolved.
